# Reflected light (GI): the acceptance clips of step 2 of the ray-tracing revisit
# (reports/render-features/2026-11-08-rt-revisit/README.md): the user judges «без GI | GI» by eye. Clips only, no
# shots. The places and camera set-ups of gi-clips.bench; each clip is a slow turn of the held camera (1 s still,
# 9 s turn, 1 s still), the last one a walk down the harbour street (route: the hero is placed on the path every
# fixed step, so both runs move the same; he and the npcs are hidden, he would slide without steps). A turn before
# a clip (`cloth camera-turn <deg> 1`) sets the first view; 10 s after it light the probes before `rec`.
# Run it once per variant, the same window, and put the halves side by side:
#   OPENGOTHIC_RT=0                  TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh gi-accept
#   OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_GI=1 OPENGOTHIC_EYE=0  TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=2560x1440 BENCH_HOST=ryzen scripts/bench.sh gi-accept
#   OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_GI=1  (GI + the eye's adaptation, on by default)  ... the same
# @timeout 2400
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off

# 1. The candle- and torch-lit harbour house of perf-interior at 22:00: from the cabinet on the right past the candle
#    and the lit wall to the shelves in the dark corner on the left.
set time 22 0
goto pos 3924 -73 -6663
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 110
cam world 160 170 180
wait 3000
cam hold
cloth camera-turn -20 1
wait 10000
rec interior-night
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn 90 9000
wait 1000
stop

# 2. The plank hut of the harbour's poor quarter at noon: from the sunlit wall on the left to the dark corner and the
#    window on the right.
set time 12 0
goto NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_HUT_01_IN
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 110
cam world 180 170 0
wait 3000
cam hold
cloth camera-turn 30 1
wait 10000
rec hut-day
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn -90 9000
wait 1000
stop

# 3. A street of the harbour's poor quarter at midnight: the lamp post and the lit house on the left, then the street
#    to the right.
set time 0 0
goto NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_PATH_06
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 120
cam world 500 200 270
wait 3000
cam hold
cloth camera-turn 30 1
wait 10000
rec harbour-night
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn -90 9000
wait 1000
stop

# 4. The same street at midnight, walked: the camera follows 5 m behind the hero from PATH_04 to PATH_06 (10.5 m at
#    1.2 m/s, past the lamp posts; further on the camera passes through a beam). Probes are placed by the distance
#    to the camera: light popping in shows here. `route` lifts the hero 50 cm from the ground to the waypoint on its
#    first step, so the camera jumps at 1.0 s: the side-by-side starts at frame 31.
goto NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_PATH_04
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 120
cam world 500 200 180
view hide animated morph
wait 10000
rec harbour-night-walk
wait 1000
route 120 NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_PATH_04 NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_PATH_05 NW_CITY_HABOUR_POOR_AREA_PATH_06
wait 1000
stop
view full

# 5. The forest at noon under the crowns: from the rock on the left across the sunlit valley to the slope in the shade
#    on the right.
set time 12 0
goto NW_FOREST_PATH_66
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 130
cam world 400 140 180
wait 3000
cam hold
cloth camera-turn 30 1
wait 10000
rec forest-day
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn -90 9000
wait 1000
stop

# 6. The bandit cave by Lobart's farm at noon: from the mouth with daylight on the left to the fire on the right.
goto NW_FARM1_BANDITS_CAVE_02
clear 3000
watch player
cam look 120
cam world 350 180 0
wait 3000
cam hold
cloth camera-turn 20 1
wait 10000
rec cave-day
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn -100 9000
wait 1000
stop

# 7. The same cave at 23:00: the dark mouth, then the fire.
set time 23 0
cam world 350 180 0
wait 3000
cam hold
cloth camera-turn 20 1
wait 10000
rec cave-night
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn -100 9000
wait 1000
stop

# The eye's adaptation under GI (step-2-shade.md, «Привыкание глаза»): run this file three times — OPENGOTHIC_RT=0,
# OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_GI=1 OPENGOTHIC_EYE=0, OPENGOTHIC_RT=1 OPENGOTHIC_GI=1 — and put the thirds side by side.
# The clips below show the adaptation over time; the hero walks (`walkto`, real steps), the camera follows him.

# 8. The forest at noon: the hero runs out of the crowns at NW_FOREST_PATH_66 onto the open slope towards PATH_67
#    (10 s there to adapt), then the clip: into the forest under the crowns and back out; the frame brightens going
#    in (1 stop/s) and darkens coming out (3 stops/s). Player input (`face wp`, `hold forward`): `walkto` does not move
#    the hero here, and a `goto` to PATH_67 leaves him stuck in a hollow. The hero turns to the forest before the clip
#    and the camera follows 2.5 m behind: turned at once in the clip, with 4 m, it flew into the slope behind him.
#    He runs out 1.2 s: 2 s put the camera against a movable object (a fire with a grate) in the hollow, a grey plane.
set time 12 0
goto NW_FOREST_PATH_66
clear 3000
watch player
walkmode run
cam lift on
cam follow 250 160 180
wait 3000
face wp NW_FOREST_PATH_67
hold forward 1200
wait 2200
face wp NW_FOREST_PATH_66
wait 10000
rec forest-walk
wait 2000
hold forward 2000
wait 7600
face wp NW_FOREST_PATH_67
hold forward 2000
wait 5300
stop

# 9. Into the bandit cave by Lobart's farm from the path outside (NW_FARM1_PATH_BANDITS_11) past CAVE_01 towards the
#    mouth at CAVE_02 and out again, at noon; player input as above.
goto NW_FARM1_PATH_BANDITS_11
clear 3000
watch player
walkmode run
cam follow 400 160 180
wait 10000
rec cave-walk
wait 2000
face wp NW_FARM1_BANDITS_CAVE_01
hold forward 2500
wait 2600
face wp NW_FARM1_BANDITS_CAVE_02
hold forward 2200
wait 5800
face wp NW_FARM1_BANDITS_CAVE_01
hold forward 2200
wait 2300
face wp NW_FARM1_PATH_BANDITS_11
hold forward 2500
wait 5100
stop
walkmode walk
cam lift off

# 10. A turn of 360 degrees in 12 s at the cave's mouth, from the camera of cave-day-1 (`cam at`: the walks above
#     leave the hero elsewhere): inside, out of the mouth, inside.
goto NW_FARM1_BANDITS_CAVE_02
clear 3000
watch player
cam at -1628 753 -10995 -1968 745 -10988
wait 10000
rec cave-mouth-turn
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn 360 12000
wait 1000
stop

# 11. A turn of 360 degrees in 12 s in the forest under the crowns, from the camera of forest-1.
goto NW_FOREST_PATH_66
clear 3000
watch player
cam at 31312 4256 27114 31310 4297 26730
wait 10000
rec forest-turn
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn 360 12000
wait 1000
stop

# 12. The market at noon from the camera of market-day: the control, the open sun; GI and GI + the eye alike.
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
clear 3000
watch player
cam at 7406 548 -4383 7406 388 -5083
wait 10000
rec market-day
wait 1000
cloth camera-turn -45 9000
wait 1000
stop
